        "answer": {
          "short": "$(x^2-x-1)(x^2+x+1)$\n\nRecognise $x^4-(x+1)^2$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x^4-x^2-2x-1&=x^4-(x+1)^2\\\\x^4-x^2-2x-1&=[x^2-(x+1)][x^2+(x+1)]\\\\x^4-x^2-2x-1&=(x^2-x-1)(x^2+x+1).\\end{align*}$$",
